    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4972" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάρτ-ῠρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without witness, unattested,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.149
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				59.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαρτύρων εὔντων</span>”
